            ]
          },
          "worked": "From part (a), on the original domain,\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\tan\\theta&=0\\\\\\tan\\theta&=0\\\\\\theta&=0,\\pi,2\\pi.\\end{align*}$$\nAt each candidate $\\sin\\theta=0$, so $\\cot\\theta$ and $\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta$ are undefined. None can be substituted into the original equation.\nThere is no solution.",
